{
  "title": "Decide snapshot coverage for prose-only Smitten Kitchen posts",
  "description": "While restoring the URLs pruned from \
`data/pipeline-snapshot-urls.json` in #482, `make pipeline` still failed on \
`https://smittenkitchen.com/2008/07/huevos-rancheros/` because the page has \
Jetpack `hrecipe` metadata with an empty recipe body and prose-only \
directions. Commit #493 intentionally pinned this exact page with \
`old_smitten_kitchen_prose_only_post_fails_cleanly` so we fail with \
`recipeIngredient (empty)` instead of inventing ingredients from narrative \
text.\n\
\n\
Decide whether this kind of page should remain excluded from snapshot \
coverage, be handled by a manually reviewed site-specific extraction rule, or \
be represented some other way. Do not re-add the URL to \
`data/pipeline-snapshot-urls.json` until `make pipeline` can regenerate it \
without contradicting the #493 correctness decision.",
  "status": "open",
  "priority": 3,
  "type": "task",
